      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.84,
      "end_seconds": 6.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "hi there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.17,
      "end_seconds": 12.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "so so what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.76,
      "end_seconds": 28.59,
      "duration_seconds": 15.83,
      "text": "I'm here cos of a swollen calf after a long drive. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.18,
      "end_seconds": 32.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.42,
      "end_seconds": 42.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.76,
      "end_seconds": 65.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, pressure 113 over 77, pulse is 111 beats a minute, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.49,
      "end_seconds": 69.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Right, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.15,
      "end_seconds": 73.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.86,
      "end_seconds": 94.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.44,
      "end_seconds": 98.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "ever since... since this morning, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.5,
      "end_seconds": 103.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "And what about fever cough or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.37,
      "end_seconds": 110.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "mm uh no I haven't had any of them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.17,
      "end_seconds": 113.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "how about coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.39,
      "end_seconds": 118.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "No I haven't had any coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.7,
      "end_seconds": 121.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.43,
      "end_seconds": 123.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.13,
      "end_seconds": 127.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.48,
      "end_seconds": 133.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "that's normal as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.29,
      "end_seconds": 150.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.2,
      "end_seconds": 152.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "No no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.22,
      "end_seconds": 155.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.44,
      "end_seconds": 159.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.81,
      "end_seconds": 183.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.01,
      "end_seconds": 195.71,
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.32,
      "end_seconds": 200.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.57,
      "end_seconds": 206.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.32,
      "end_seconds": 210.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.33,
      "end_seconds": 214.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "The contraceptive pill, daily"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.55,
      "end_seconds": 218.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.88,
      "end_seconds": 221.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.15,
      "end_seconds": 237.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Your oxygen is lower than expected for someone so young and the left calf is a little swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.52,
      "end_seconds": 244.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "right, good, you can sit up again"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.4,
      "end_seconds": 258.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found this is probably possible pulmonary embolism without chest pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.74,
      "end_seconds": 261.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.92,
      "end_seconds": 296.98,
      "duration_seconds": 35.06,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's possible pulmonary embolism without chest pain and we'll know more once the a D-dimer is back we should do a D-dimer for syncope and calf swelling i'd rather check than guess and this is the quickest way to know more even without chest pain this needs a scan today so please go to hospital let's get you seen by the emergency team I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.17,
      "end_seconds": 303.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Please come and see me straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.85,
      "end_seconds": 313.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "right, I'll do that thank you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.41,
      "end_seconds": 317.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "So, have a good day."
    }
  ]
